 Community - Crossing, Douyin Music Edition - Soda Music, Douyin\'s Medium and Long Video Version - Green Peach Video, Douyin\'s Internet TV/Interactive Internet Protocol Television Platform - Fresh Time, Simplified Edition and other related versions) and related websites (","/**_*_\u521b\u670d\u8bf7\u6c42\u7684\u4ee3\u7801\u6a21\u677f_____________*__param_params_____________*__returns_____________*":"\\n          /**\\n            * \u521b\u670d\u8bf7\u6c42\u7684\u4ee3\u7801\u6a21\u677f\\n            * @param params\\n            * @returns\\n            */\\n            async function webcastAxiosFetchAdapter<Req = Request, Res = RawResponse>(requestOption: RequestParams<Req>): Promise<Res> {\\n              const { params, url, method } = requestOption;\\n              return new Promise((resolve, reject) => {\\n                request({\\n                  method,\\n                  url,\\n                  params: {\\n                    ...params,\\n                    version_code: \'24.0.0\', \\n                    aid: \'2906\'\\n                  }\\n                }).then(res => {\\n                  const { data, status_code } = res;\\n                  if (status_code === 0) {\\n                    resolve(data);\\n                  } \\n                }).catch(e => {\\n                  console.log(e);\\n                  reject(e);\\n                });\\n              });\\n            }","/{consumptiontimes}_times":"/{consumptionTimes} times","/{placeholder1}_times":"/{placeholder1} times","100_seconds":"100 seconds","1_do_not_use_materials_or_content_unrelated_to_the_promotion_of_the_game__includ":"1. Do not use materials or content unrelated to the promotion of the game, including but not limited to unrelated film footage, live talent, etc.","1_invite_multiple_people_to_complete_the_work_together__and_you_can_initiate_up_":"1. Invite multiple people to complete the work together, and you can initiate up to 4 co-creation submission invitations within each natural month. You need to add the co-creator and co-creation identity.","1_only_horizontal_video_can_be_synced_to_watermelon_video":"1. Only horizontal video can be synced to watermelon video","1_open":"1. Open","1_portrait_screen_video":"1. Portrait screen video","1_quick_detection_is_a_committal_hearing_service_provided_by_little_assistant_to":"1. Quick Detection is a committal hearing service provided by Little Assistant to Douyin creators\\\\ n2. Using Quick Detection, creators can know some work problems and optimization suggestions in advance\\\\ n3. Since there is no manual judgment, the quick detection results are different from the review results\\\\ n4. You can upload your work at any time and start testing, generally you can know the results within {timeout} minutes","1_select_the_priority_display_column___feed_bottom_bar_is_displayed_as_[knowledg":"1. Select the priority display column - Feed bottom bar is displayed as [Knowledge \xb7 Column Name]","1_the_title_of_the_work_only_supports_text_input__if_you_need_to_add_#topic_and_":"1. The title of the work only supports text input. If you need to add #topic and @friend, please enter it in the work introduction area","2_after_the_public_work_of_the_public_account_is_successfully_released__the_invi":"2. After the public work of the public account is successfully released, the invited co-creator can accept the invitation through the \\"Creator Assistant\\", and after successful acceptance, it will be displayed under the work as the co-creator.","2_do_not_promote_the_game_through_illegal_means_such_as_false_or_excessive_marke":"2. Do not promote the game through illegal means such as false or excessive marketing.","2_do_not_select_the_priority_display_column___the_display_bar_at_the_bottom_of_t":"2. Do not select the priority display column - the display bar at the bottom of the Feed is [Collection \xb7 Collection Name]","2_douyin_s_video_description_and_cover_will_be_automatically_synchronized":"2. Douyin\'s video description and cover will be automatically synchronized","2_scan_the_qr_code_above_to_enter":"2. Scan the QR code above to enter","2_the_video_that_has_been_synced_to_watermelon":"2. The video that has been synced to Watermelon","2_titled_works_will_be_displayed_first_in_the_dual_column_layout__and_the_previe":"2. Titled works will be displayed first in the dual-column layout, and the preview effect can be viewed in \\"Preview Cover/Title\\" on the right","3_if_the_component_is_untied__you_can_learn_the_specific_violation_details_throu":"3. If the component is untied, you can learn the specific violation details through the message notification.","3_if_you_delete_the_content_in_douyin__the_corresponding_content_in_watermelon_w":"3. If you delete the content in Douyin, the corresponding content in Watermelon will still be retained.","3_only_you_can_modify_the_information_of_the_co_created_works__extract_the_incom":"3. Only you can modify the information of the co-created works, extract the income of the co-created works, etc. Please negotiate with the members offline to share the account.","3_please_avoid_filling_in_the_same_content_in_the_title_and_introduction_of_the_":"3. Please avoid filling in the same content in the title and introduction of the work.","3_watermelon_syncs_to_douyin_s_video":"3. Watermelon syncs to Douyin\'s video","4_content_that_is_allowed_to_be_downloaded_in_douyin_can_also_be_downloaded_to_t":"4. Content that is allowed to be downloaded in Douyin can also be downloaded to the \\"Local Album\\" in Watermelon.","4_identity_should_accurately_correspond_to_the_author_s_contribution__otherwise_":"4. Identity should accurately correspond to the author\'s contribution, otherwise it will untie the co-creation relationship","4_to_learn_more__click":"4. To learn more, click","4_videos_under_review_and_review_disapproved":"4. Videos under review and review disapproved","5_the_release_time_of_the_synchronized_work_will_be_the_same_as