vity time","activity_time__{placeholder1}___{placeholder3}":"Activity time: {placeholder1} - {placeholder3}","ad_revenue":"ad revenue","add":"add","add_[{name}]_gamepad_and_participate_in_[activity_settlement]":"Add [{name}] gamepad and participate in [activity settlement]","add_a_book_tag_and_share_your_thoughts":"Add a book tag and share your thoughts","add_a_challenge":"Add a challenge","add_a_co_creator":"Add a co-creator","add_a_statement":"Add","add_activity":"Add activity","add_challenge_sticker":"Add challenge","add_chapter":"Add chapter","add_chapter_information_to_the_progress_bar_to_make_the_video_structure_clearer":"Add chapter information to the progress bar to make the video structure clearer","add_co_creation":"Add co-creation","add_collection":"Add collection","add_directly":"add directly","add_filter_missing_filter_id":"Add filter Missing filter id","add_filter_setting_error__please_click_retry":"Add filter setting error, please click Retry","add_full_text_summary":"Add full text summary","add_game":"Add game","add_hints_to_your_work_so_that_users_can_better_understand_the_creative_informat":"Add hints to understand the creative information","add_link":"Add link","add_location":"Add location","add_music":"Add music","add_product_label":"Add product label","add_tag":"Add tag","add_text":"Add text","add_the_same_game_as_the_work":"Add the same game as the work","add_the_same_game_as_the_work__{placeholder1}":"Add the same game as the work, {placeholder1}","add_to":"Add to","add_to_bed_the_scene":"Add to bed-the-scene","add_to_course_column":"Add to Course Column","add_to_skit_paid_feature?":"Add to skit paid feature?","add_up_to_7_products":"Add up to 7 products","add_up_to_one_chapter_in_5_seconds":"Add up to one chapter in 5 seconds","add_up_to_{cart_limit}_items":"Add up to {CART_LIMIT} items","add_up_to_{max_chapter_length}_video_chapters":"Add up to {MAX_CHAPTER_LENGTH} video chapters","add_up_to_{placeholder1}_co_creators":"Add up to {placeholder1} co-creators","add_with_one_click":"Add with one click","add_work_description___":"Share more about your graphics here...","add_work_introduction":"Share more about your video here...","add_work_title":"Add a title that describes your graphics","added":"Added","added_effects_will_be_deleted":"Added effects will be deleted","added_item_({placeholder1})":"Added item ({placeholder1})","added_paid_content":"Added paid content","added_to_paid_collection__paid_video_cannot_be_set_separately":"Added to paid collection, paid video cannot be set separately","adding_":"Adding..","adding_activities_will_have_the_opportunity_to_earn_traffic_rewards":"Adding activities will have the opportunity to earn traffic rewards","adding_chapters_to_video_content_can_make_the_video_structure_clearer":"Adding chapters to video content can make the video structure clearer","adding_enterprise_accounts_is_not_supported_":"Adding enterprise accounts is not supported.","additional_broadcast_consumption_share":"additional broadcast consumption share","additional_settings":"additional settings","adjust_the_size_and_position_of_the_sticker_here_":"Adjust the size and position of the sticker here.","advertising_delivery_specifications__provide_testing_of_whether_it_meets_the_com":"Advertising delivery specifications: Provide testing of whether it meets the community advertising delivery specifications. If the work does not have an advertising delivery plan, you can ignore this prompt and submit the manuscript normally.\\nIf there is any abnormality in the detection, it is recommended to modify it according to the prompts of the illegal content before submitting the article.","advertising_traffic_does_not_participate_in_settlement":"Advertising traffic does not participate in settlement","after_2_hours_and_within_14_days_of_support__when_the_work_has_not_reached_the_r":"After 2 hours and within 14 days of support. When the work has not reached the release time, you can go to the work management to modify the release time.","after_a_user_downloads_a_game_you_promote_for_the_first_time__the_user_is_regard":"After a user downloads a game you promote for the first time, the user is regarded as a user brought by your promotion (referred to as \\"binding\\"), and the game consumption of the bound user is included in the aforementioned total game consumption. If the user does not log in to the game for 60 consecutive days or you do not [go LIVE] for 60 consecutive days, you will be untied from the user, and his game consumption will no longer be included in the aforementioned game consumption; if the user re-downloads the game through the widget component mounted in your [live stream/video], he can re-bind to you.","after_activating_{placeholder1}":"After activating {placeholder1}","after_checking__add_a_game_to_automatically_participate_":"After checking, add a game to automatically participate.","after_clicking_cancel__the_entered_chapter_content_will_not_be_saved":"After clicking Cancel, the entered chapter content will not be saved","after_clicking_ok__the_filled_information_will_be_overwritten_":"After clicking OK, the filled information will be overwritten.","after_clicking_publish__if_the_work_is_still_being_uploaded__please_do_not_close":"If the file is still being uploaded, please do not close the page and wait for the upload and release to complete.","after_closing__posting_videos_cannot_get_streaming_traffic_and_commission_income":"After closing, posting videos cannot get streaming traffic and commission income.","after_closing__the_current_position_is_fixed__which_may_affect_traffic_and_conve":"After closing, the current position is fixed, which may affect traffic and conversions","after_only_{placeholder1}_{placeholder2}_is_supported__within_{placeholder4}_{pl":"After only {placeholder1} {placeholder2} is supported, within {placeholder4} {placeholder5}","after_opening__each_published_work_will_be_automatically_published_to_the_design":"Once enabled, each work will be automatically published to the designated product simultaneously","after_opening__the_store_or_other_chain_stores_applicable_to_the_same_product_wi":"After opening, the store or other chain stores applicable to the same product will be intelligently displayed based on the positioning of the user browsing the video, resulting in better traffic and conversion results","after_opening__this_location_addition_can_carry_out_delivery_related_operations_":"After opening, this location addition can carry out delivery-related operations. After publishing the video, you can get the corresponding traffic and commission income of store promotion.","after_opening__your_paid_content_will_have_the_opportunity_to_be_displayed_to_us_3":"After opening, your paid content will have the opportunity to be displayed to users, and users can watch the full version after purchasing. The platform will charge you a 30% technical service fee for the total amount of the order and settle it with you. If the above ratio changes, the platform will notify you separately.","after_release__there_is_a_high_probability_of_entering_manual_review_":"After release, there is a high probability of entering manual review.","after_setting_the_same_clip__the_player_clicks_the_small_handle_to_directly_expe":"After setting the same clip, the player clicks the small handle to directly experience the specified scene in the game without downloading the game clip.","after_setting_the_same_clip__the_player_clicks_the_small_handle_to_go_directly_t":"After setting the same clip, the player clicks the small handle to go directly to the designated scene in the game","after_some_applications_are_logged_in_through_douyin_authorization__they_can_be_":"After some applications are logged in through Douyin authorization, they can be released at the same time; the authorization can be lifted in the \\"Settings-Account and Security-Authorization Management\\" of Douyin mobile end","after_the_public_work_of_the_public_account_is_successfully_released__the_invite":"After the public work of the public account is successfully released, the invited co-creators can accept the invitation through the \\"Creator Assistant\\". After successfully accepting, they will be displayed under the work as the co-creator and share the copyright of the work with you.","after_the_release__the_platform_will_review_the_work__it_will_take_about_5_minut":"After the release, the platform will review the work, it will take about 5 minutes, and the result will be notified through an in-app letter.","after_the_review_is_passed__the_video_will_be_automatically_released__and_there_":"After the review is passed, the video will be automatically released, and there is no need to upload it again through normal channels.","after_the_video_is_successfully_released__the_price_cannot_be_changed_":"After the video is successfully released, the price cannot be changed.","after_the_work_is_approved__the_modification_operation_will_take_effect__and_the":"After the work is approved, the modification operation will take effect, and the historical interaction data will be retained. If the original work has a soundtrack set, it will be replaced by the currently uploaded video music. If you have any questions, please consult Douyin customer service.","after_the_work_is_approved__the_modification_operation_will_take_effect__and_the_2":"After the work is approved, the modification operation will take effect, and the historical data will be retained. If you have any questions, please consult Douyin customer service.","after_the_work_is_published_to_other_applications__it_is_independent_of_douyin__":"After the work is published to other applications, it is independent of Douyin, follows the rules and content restrictions of the application platform, and is not affected by changes in Douyin (such as setting privacy, deletion, etc.)","after_the_work_is_successfully_uploaded__the_detection_will_automatically_start_":"After the work is successfully uploaded, the detection will automatically start, which is expected to take {placeholder1} minutes","after_unchecking__you_will_not_be_able_to_get_the_activity_income_":"After unchecking, you will not be able to get the activity income.","after_viewing_and_confirming__it_can_be_published_with_the_video_":"After viewing and confirming, it can be published with the video.","after_{placeholder0}":"After {placeholder0}","age_font":"Age font","agreed_to_the_paid_content_feature_usage_agreement":"Agreed to the Paid Content Feature Usage Agreement","agreement_confirmation":"agreement confirmation","agriculture_rural_areas_and_farmers":"agriculture, rural areas and farmers","alignment":"alignment","all":"all","all_hotspots":"All hotspots","all_users_who_download_and_activate_from_douyin_may_recharge_after_watching_your":"All users who download and activate from Douyin may recharge after watching your content or interacting with you, and you may get a share of the proceeds.","all_work_suggestions_have_been_obtained__the_results_are_provided_by_machine_ins":"All work suggestions have been obtained. The results are provided by machine inspection, and the following optimization items are found within the detection range, and the work review pass rate is low","all_works":"All works","allow":"Yes","allow_others_to_save/disallow_others_to_save":"Allow others to save/disallow others to save","allow_others_to_save_images":"Allow others to save images","allow_others_to_save_videos":"Allow others to download videos","an_error_occurred__please_upload_again_":"An error occurred, please upload again.","an_unknown_error_has_occurred_":"An unknown error has occurred.","anchor_mark":"Mark everything","android":"Android","android_/ios":"Android /IOS","animals_and_plants":"animals and plants","animation":"Animation","animation_two_dimensional":"Animation two-dimensional","apply_for_an_associated_hotspot":"Associated hotspot","apply_the_information_of_published_works_to_quick