video.","for_a_better_viewing_experience__it_is_recommended_to_upload_a_vertical_picture_":"For a better viewing experience, it is recommended to upload a vertical picture of 9:16.","for_a_better_viewing_experience_and_platform_security__the_platform_will_conduct":"For a better experience and platform security, the uploaded videos will be reviewed.","for_a_better_viewing_experience_and_platform_security__the_platform_will_have_co":"For a better viewing experience and platform security, the uploaded videos will be reviewed.Videos over 40 seconds are recommended to upload horizontal.","for_details__please_refer_to_":"For details, please refer to:","for_the_avoidance_of_ambiguity__if_you_mount_cloud_gaming_on_other_components_ot":"For the avoidance of ambiguity, if you mount Cloud gaming on other components other than the small handle component, anchor points (including but not limited to small windmills, small yellow carts, etc.) or undertake tasks through the huge Xingtu Platform and use the small handle component for Cloud gaming promotion, it does not belong to the behavior of \\"using game sharing and promotion functions for promotion\\" in the aforementioned definition, and the calculation and settlement of profits are not applicable to these rules.","for_videos_larger_than_1_5g__static_frame_extraction_is_not_supported_for_the_ti":"For videos larger than 1.5G, static frame extraction is not supported for the time being. We will optimize and solve it later.","for_you_feed":"For You feed","format_screen_example":"Format screen example","formatting":"formatting","founder_lanting_black_simplified":"Founder Lanting Black Simplified","four":"four","free_collection":"free collection","free_trial_duration_":"Free trial duration:","full_text_summary":"Full text summary","function_internal_test__you_can_post_videos_over_1_hour_and_within_3_hours":"Function internal test: You can post videos over 1 hour and within 3 hours","funny":"funny","game":"game","game_":"Game:","gam