:"Go to the content management page to create a collection, and you can add the video to the collection.","go_to_the_short_play_album_page_to_create_an_album_and_add_the_video_to_the_albu":"Go to the Short Play Album page to create an album and add the video to the album.","go_to_verify":"Go to verify","god":"God","golden":"golden","got_it_":"Got it.","gourmet":"Gourmet","government_affairs":"government affairs","graphic":"graphic","graphic_release_music_loading_error__{soundid}":"Graphic release Music loading error, {soundId}","graphic_release_music_playback_error__{soundid}":"Graphic release Music playback error, {soundId}","gray_orange":"Gray Orange","green_step":"green step","grey_tone":"grey tone","group_buying":"group buying","group_buying_and_bringing_goods_specifications__for_the_experts_of_life_services":"Group buying and bringing goods specifications: For the experts of life services, provide testing on whether they meet the group buying and bringing goods specifications. If the work does not have a group buying and bringing goods plan, you can ignore this prompt and submit normally.","group_buying_model":"Group buying model","guarantee_fee":"Guarantee fee","guaranteed_fee_+_commission_settlement":"Guaranteed fee + commission settlement","guess_you_want_to_add":"Guess you want to add","has_reached_the_bottom":"Has reached the bottom","have_a_try":"Have a try","hazy":"hazy","here_you_can_preview_the_cover_of_the_work_on_the_personal_homepage_of_the_mobil":"Here you can preview the cover of the work on the personal homepage of the mobile app.","hh_mm_minutes_ss_seconds":"HH mm minutes ss seconds","hi_i_am_a_posting_assistant__which_can_help_you_detect_problems_in_the_work_befo":"Hi, I am a posting assistant, which can help you detect problems in the work before publishing, make optimization suggestions, and reduce the risk of violations.","high_quality_titles_can_attract_more_visitors__such_as__1__the_summer_palace_ice":"High-quality titles can attract more visitors, such as: 1. The Summer Palace Ice Rink feels the joy of the northern winter, with a guide; 2. Often rejoice in small things, and daily life is an ode...","high_quality_works_participate_in_the_challenge_and_follow_the_auction_to_detona":"High-quality works participate in the challenge and follow the auction to detonate traffic","highest":"highest","highlight_fragment_synthesis":"Highlight fragment synthesis","hint":"hint","historical_data":"historical data","historical_works_that_might_otherwise_fail_to_mount":"Historical works that might otherwise fail to mount","home_cinema_rebate":"Home Cinema Rebate","home_display_differences":"Home Display Differences","hong_kong_style":"Hong Kong Style","horizontal":"horizontal","horizontal/vertical_double_cover_missing":"Horizontal/Vertical Double Cover Missing","horizontal_cover":"Horizontal cover","horizontal_cover_4_3":"Horizontal cover 4:3","horizontal_cover_preview_(4_3)":"Horizontal Cover Preview (4:3)","horizontal_graph":"horizontal graph","horizontal_videos_can_be_synced_to_watermelon_video_for_more_video_display_oppor":"Horizontal videos can be synced to Watermelon Video for more video display opportunities.","horizontal_videos_can_be_synced_to_watermelon_videos__and_good_titles_and_covers":"Horizontal videos can be synced to watermelon videos, and good titles and covers can gain more exposure in watermelon.","hot_songs_chart":"Hot Songs Chart","hot_spot":"hot spot","hour":"hour","how_about_self_made_progress_bar_content_recognition?":"How about self-made progress bar content recognition?","how_to_divide_the_prize_pool":"How to divide the prize pool","how_to_set_the_video_format__please_see":"How to set the video format, please see","i_have_read_and_agree":"I have read and agree","i_know_":"Oh, I see.","i_m_here_":"I\'m here.","i_think_again":"I think again","i_want_to_close":"I want to close","i_want_to_turn_on":"I want to turn on","if_the_company_verifies_and_determines_that_all_or_part_of_your_promotion_income":"If the company verifies and determines that all or part of your promotion income is invalid, for the purpose of fulfilling legal obligations, cooperating with law enforcement or fulfilling social responsibility, the company and/or game manufacturers have the right to make their own decisions to refund the user\'s game consumption money corresponding to the above invalid income; you agree to support such decisions and cooperate with the company\'s request to refund your corresponding income or equivalent amount. At this time, the platform has the right to deduct the corresponding amount from the virtual rights and interests under your account and the income balance. If the deduction is insufficient, you should make up for it within 5 working days after the company\'s notification.","if_the_company_verifies_and_determines_that_all_or_part_of_your_promotion_income_2":"If the company verifies and determines that all or part of your promotion income is invalid, for the purpose of fulfilling legal obligations, cooperating with law enforcement or fulfilling social responsibility, the company and/or game manufacturers have the right to make their own decisions to refund the user\'s game consumption money corresponding to the above invalid income; you agree to support such decisions and cooperate with the company\'s request to refund your corresponding income or equivalent amount. At this time, the platform has the right to deduct the corresponding amount from the virtual rights and interests under your account and the income balance. If the deduction is insufficient, you shall make up for it within 5 working days after the company\'s notification.","if_there_are_components_(hotspots__labels__etc_)_in_the_original_content__the_mo":"If there are components (hotspots, labels, etc.) in the original content, the modification needs to be reviewed again.","if_there_is_a_bullet_comment_in_the_original_content_and_the_modification_is_app":"If there is a bullet comment in the original content and the modification is approved, the bullet comment will be cleared in the next day.","if_there_is_a_chapter_in_the_original_content__after_the_modification_is_success":"If there is a chapter in the original content, after the modification is successful, you need to go to the chapter editor to confirm the chapter content again. If the current chapter is not reviewed, the chapter needs to be reset if the modification is approved.","if_you_accept_the_invitation_of_the_guild_to_become_the_live_streaming_host_of_t":"If you accept the invitation of the guild to become the live streaming host of the guild operation and management, the platform will settle the corresponding income to the guild according to the effective fee settlement policy at that time and based on the cooperation information you confirmed through the platform product function page (including the type of income, the sharing ratio, etc.), and you can withdraw the remaining part by yourself. You specifically agree that if there is any dispute or dispute between you and the guild during the payment distribution and settlement process, it will be handled and resolved between you and your guild, without involvement with the platform.","if_you_accept_the_invitation_of_the_guild_to_become_the_live_streaming_host_of_t_2":"If you accept the invitation of the guild to become the live streaming host of the guild operation and management, the platform will settle the corresponding income to the guild according to the effective fee settlement policy at that time and based on the cooperation information you confirmed through the platform product function page (including the type of income, the sharing ratio, etc.), and you can withdraw the remaining part by yourself. You specifically agree that if there is any dispute or dispute between you and the guild during the payment distribution and settlement process, it will be handled and resolved between you and your guild, without involvement with the platform.","if_you_delete_the_content_in_douyin__the_corresponding_content_in_watermelon_wil":"If you delete the content in Douyin, the corresponding content in Watermelon will still be retained.","if_you_encounter_any_problems_during_use__you_can_contact_the_online_customer_se":"If you encounter any problems during use, you can contact the online customer service through the \\"Suspension Entrance\\" in the lower right corner or have more comments/suggestions. Welcome to click [Settings] - [Feedback and Help] in the Douyin APP, and then submit your suggestions and comments at [Feedback].","if_you_participate_in_the_promotion_task/activity__the_final_reward_is_subject_t":"If you participate in the promotion task/activity, the final reward is subject to the rules of the promotion/activity page.","if_your_work_is_added_to_the_collection_and_column_at_the_same_time__after_selec":"If your work is added to the collection and column at the same time, after selecting [Priority Display Column], the work will still display the original collection and column;","ignore":"ignore","illegal_video_message":"Illegal video message","image_editing":"image editing","image_file_size_does_not_exceed_50mb":"Maximum size: 50MB","image_format":"Image formats","image_loading_failed":"Image loading failed","image_loading_failed!":"Image loading failed!","image_resolution_must_be_greater_than_{min_width}_*_{min_height}":"Image resolution must be greater than {MIN_WIDTH} * {MIN_HEIGHT}","image_scale":"Image Scale","image_size":"Image Size","image_size_does_not_exceed_{placeholder1}_mb":"Image size does not exceed {placeholder1} MB","image_size_too_large":"The picture size is too large, please re-crop/upload.","image_size_too_small":"The picture resolution is too low, please re-crop/upload.","immediate_release":"Now","in_order_to_create_a_good_community_ecosystem__the_douyin_platform_has_recently_":"In order to create a good community ecosystem, the Douyin platform has recently launched a standardized expression prompt function to help creators detect irregular expression content in copywriting, including but not limited to typos, wrong grammar, irregular abbreviations, and irregular variants.","in_order_to_enrich_your_content_sharing_platform__improve_your_content_exposure_":"In order to enrich your content sharing platform, improve your content exposure and publishing efficiency, you agree to authorize the company to automatically and synchronously publish all the content published by your account in \\"Douyin\\" software and related services and corresponding accounts to PICO (hereinafter referred to as \\"","in_order_to_ensure_your_promotion_rights__please_read_and_abide_by_carefully_bef":"In order to ensure your promotion rights, please read and abide by carefully before promoting the game:","in_order_to_increase_the_flow_of_the_work__it_is_recommended_to_set_up_both_hori":"In order to increase the flow of the work, it is recommended to set up both horizontal and vertical covers","in_order_to_protect_the_rights_and_interests_of_creators__others_are_not_allowed":"In order to protect the rights and interests of creators, others are not allowed to save paid videos","in_the_event_of_an_adjustment_in_the_income_ratio_(including_an_increase_or_decr":"In the event of an adjustment in the income ratio (including an increase or decrease), the platform will notify you through in-app letters, message notifications, announcements, pop-ups, emails, etc. From the time the adjustment takes effect, the platform will calculate and settle your promotion income according to the new income ratio.","in_the_promotion_mode__the_total_amount_of_money_paid_by_the_user_for_consumptio":"In the promotion mode, the total amount of money paid by the user for consumption in the game after downloading the game based on your use of the game sharing and promotion function and [live broadcast/release video] for game promotion, excluding bad debts and the amount of game coins or virtual items or gift packages presented to the user in any activities provided by the company and/or affiliated companies, game manufacturers, etc. The game consumption generated by the user through other channels, methods or other people\'s promotion of downloading the game is not included in the total game consumption mentioned above, and the company does not need to pay you any income based on this. For the avoidance of ambiguity, if you mount the game on other components other than the small handle component, anchor points (including but not limited to small windmills, small yellow carts, etc.), or undertake tasks through the huge Xingtu Platform, and use the small handle component for game promotion, it does not belong to the behavior of \\"using game sharing and promotion functions for promotion\\" in the aforementioned definition, and these rules do not apply to the calculation and settlement of income.","in_this_panel__you_can_choose_to_mount_the_paid_label_of_the_current_work_to_the":"In this panel, you can choose to mount the paid label of the current work to the historical work\\nProducts, help to monetize more efficiently. The current page only displays works without labels.","inaccurate_recommendation?_go_search_for_the_same_game":"Inaccurate recommendation? Go search for the same game","incentive_activity":"Incentive activity","includes_{placeholder1}_rebate_items":"Includes {placeholder1} rebate items","including_the_newly_added_supplier_products_in_the_later_stage_of_the_store":"Including the newly added supplier products in the later stage of the store","income_description":"Income Description","incomplete":"incomplete","incomplete_display_of_main_people/things_on_the_cover":"Incomplete display of main people/things on the cover","incomplete_text_display":"incomplete text display","independent_editor":"Independent editor","industry":"Industry","inspirational":"inspirational","install":"install","install_blocking_prompt":"Install blocking prompt","instructions_for_using_public_welfare_project_links":"Instructions for using public welfare project links","insufficient_health_points__description_is_limited_to_{maxlen}_characters__for_d":"Insufficient health points, description is limited to {maxLen} characters. For details, go to Douyin app-Security Center-Health Points","insufficient_health_points__upload_is_prohibited__for_details__go_to_douyin_app_":"Insufficient health points, upload is prohibited. For details, go to Douyin app-Security Center-Health points","intelligent_generation":"Intelligent generation","intelligent_generation_has_been_completed__to_be_confirmed":"Intelligent generation has been completed, to be confirmed","intelligent_generation_takes_about_a_few_minutes__but_it_can_be_confirmed_later_":"Intelligent generation takes about a few minutes, but it can be confirmed later, and it will be shown to others after confirmation.","intelligent_recommendation_of_related_products":"Intelligent recommendation of related products","intelligent_recommendation_of_related_products__effect_preview":"Intelligent recommendation of related products, effect preview","interface_complete":"Interface complete","interface_start":"Interface start","international":"international","investment_consumption_share":"investment consumption share","invite_multiple_people_to_complete_the_work_together__and_you_can_initiate_up_to":"Invite multiple people to complete the work together, and you can initiate up to 4 co-creation submission invitations within each natural month. You need to add the co-creator and co-creation identity.","invite_you_to_experience_the_test_function__and_the_video_transaction_volume_wil":"Invite you to experience the test function, and the video transaction volume will increase approximately","ios_side":"IOS side","it_has_been_set_as_paid_video_separately_and_cannot_be_added_to_paid_collections":"It has been set as paid video separately and cannot be added to paid collections","it_is_detected_that_your_video_lasts_more_than_1_hour__and_the_review_time_after":"It is detected that your video lasts more than 1 hour, and the review time after publication is long. Please be patient.","it_is_forbidden_to_add_paid_content_tags_and_publish_to_the_skit_album_at_the_sa":"It is forbidden to add paid content tags and publish to the skit album at the same time, please delete the tags or move out of the skit album","it_is_forbidden_to_use_any_cheating_or_illegal_means_to_affect_the_data_statisti":"It is forbidden to use any cheating or illegal means to affect the data statistics of the mounted anchor points, or to use any means to falsify data, and the platform has the right not to settle the cheating data.","it_is_not_recommended_that_the_width_to_height_ratio_exceed_1_2__recommended_pic":"Recommended picture width-to-height ratio: 3:4, 4:3.The 1:2 is not recommended. ","it_is_recognized_that_there_is_a_bullet_comment_in_your_original_content__if_the":"It is recognized that there is a bullet comment in your original content. If the modification is approved, the bullet comment will be cleared within the next day. Please confirm whether to continue submitting?","it_is_recommended_to_add_homemade_progress_bars_as_chapters_with_one_click_to_he":"It is recommended to add homemade progress bars as chapters with one click to help viewers quickly navigate to specific paragraphs.","it_is_recommended_to_add_the_{d}_version_cover_to_increase_the_flow_of_the_work":"It is recommended to add the {d} version cover to increase the flow of the work","it_is_recommended_to_adjust_the_composition_to_ensure_that_the_main_person/thing":"It is recommended to adjust the composition to ensure that the main person/thing of the picture is displayed completely","it_is_recommended_to_adjust_the_text_position__incomplete_text_cropping_will_aff":"It is recommended to adjust the text position. Incomplete text cropping will affect the complete expression of the information.","it_is_recommended_to_avoid_using_solid_colors__gaussian_blur_and_other_borders_i":"It is recommended to avoid using solid colors, Gaussian blur and other borders in the cover","it_is_recommended_to_choose_pictures_that_match_the_video_specifications":"It is recommended to choose pictures that match the video specifications","it_is_recommended_to_choose_the_same_cover_size_as_the_video_specifications":"It is recommended to choose the same cover size as the video specifications","it_is_recommended_to_replace_it_with_a_cover_with_a_resolution_higher_than_720p_":"It is recommended to replace it with a cover with a resolution higher than 720p, and the blurred cover will affect the effect.","it_is_recommended_to_turn_on_in_depth_inspection_to_obtain_manual_committal_hear":"It is recommended to turn on in-depth inspection to obtain manual committal hearing suggestions","it_is_recommended_to_upload_videos_with_aspect_ratios_of_16_9__9_16__3_4__4_3__9":"It is recommended to upload videos with aspect ratios of 16:9, 9:16, 3:4, 4:3, 9:19.5 (5.8 inches)","it_is_recommended_to_use_high_definition_pictures_with_a_definition_of_not_less_":"It is recommended to use high definition pictures with a definition of not less than 1280 * 960p (horizontal 4:3) or 960 * 1280 (vertical 3:4). A clear, beautiful and informative cover will help the video get more traffic","it_means_that_after_a_new_user_enters_the_cloud_gaming_page_you_promote_through_":"It means that after a new user enters the Cloud gaming page you promote through the widget you mounted and logs in to the Cloud gaming with his Douyin account, the user will be regarded as an activated user brought about by your promotion. If the user does not log in to the Cloud gaming after downloading the game, it will not be regarded as having completed the activation and will not count your game promotion income.","it_will_take_about_a_few_minutes_for_intelligent_generation__you_can_publish_the":"It will take about a few minutes for intelligent generation. You can publish the v