uration and effect, etc.), the promotion requirements and promotable game lists of each creator may be different, and the revenue calculation rules of the same promotion method/task may also be different. Please be sure to read the specific promotion requirements, income calculation rules and other information carefully before starting the promotion, pay attention to distinguish between different models, different promotion methods/tasks, and choose according to your own situation. You can check the specific amount of your promotion income through [Douyin-Me-Wallet-My Income], and operate through the platform to extract such income according to the withdrawal methods and withdrawal rules provided by the platform.","please_note_that_the_promotion_requirements_and_revenue_calculation_rules_for_ea_2":"Please note that the promotion requirements and revenue calculation rules for each promotion method/task are different (under the same promotion method/task, the calculation rules for video promotion revenue and live broadcast promotion revenue will be set and settled separately). At the same time, based on the specific circumstances of each creator\'s live broadcast/video submission activities (including but not limited to content quality, interactive communication effect, active level, content scarcity, promotion duration and effect, etc.), the promotion requirements and promotable game lists of each creator may be different, and the revenue calculation rules of the same promotion method/task may also be different. Please be sure to read the specific promotion requirements, income calculation rules and other information carefully before starting the promotion, pay attention to distinguish between different models, different promotion methods/tasks, and choose according to your own situation. You can check the specific amount of your promotion income through [Douyin-Me-Wallet-My Income], and operate through the platform to extract such income according to the withdrawal 