the transaction.","recommend_more_products_that_users_are_interested_in__and_you_can_get_a_commissi":"Recommend more products that users are interested in, and you can get a commission after the transaction.","recommend_more_related_products__and_the_video_transaction_volume_can_be_increas":"Recommend more related products, and the video transaction volume can be increased by about < span style = \\"color: #FE2C55;\\" > 15% </span >","recommend_more_templates_for_you":"Recommend more templates for you","recommendation_function_is_enabled":"Recommendation function is enabled","recommended_based_on_current_releases":"Recommended based on current releases","recommended_duration":"recommended duration","recommended_feature_turned_off":"Recommended feature turned off","recommended_hotspot":"recommended hotspot","recommended_image_ratio_4_3":"Recommended image ratio 4:3","recommended_jpg__jpeg__png__webp_format__gif_format_is_not_supported":"Recommended jpg, jpeg, png, webp format, gif format is not supported","recommended_optimization":"recommended optimization","recommended_products_in_the_same_store":"Recommended products in the same store","recommended_resolution_range__720p_1080p__maximum_support_for_uploading_4k_(3840":"Recommended resolution range: 720P-1080P, maximum support for 4k (3840 x 2160)","recommended_two_column_effect_preview":"Recommended two-column effect preview","recovery_failed__please_select_the_cover_again_":"Recovery failed, please select the cover again.","recruit":"recruit","recruitment_task":"recruitment task","refers_to_1)_applications_for_refunds__unsuccessful_payments__etc__that_occur_af":"Refers to 1) applications for refunds, unsuccessful payments, etc. that occur after the user downloads the game and consumes the game, refunds and other unrecoverable payments after being approved by the payment channel; and 2) requests from government authorities and refunds from companies and/or affiliates, game manufacturers, etc. to users.","refers_to_the_application_for_refund__unsuccessful_payment__etc__that_occurs_aft":"Refers to the application for refund, unsuccessful payment, etc. that occurs after the user activates Cloud gaming for game consumption, the refund and other unrecoverable payments after approval by the payment channel; and the requirements of government authorities and the company and/or affiliates, game manufacturers, etc. to refund the user.","refers_to_the_bound_user_(including_ios_system_user_and_android_system_user)_who":"Refers to the bound user (including IOS system user and Android system user) who activates the Cloud gaming for the first time based on your promotion behavior in the promotion mode. If the user has previously activated the Cloud gaming through the platform (including but not limited to the official download page of the game, search page, Douyin game center, advertisements placed by game manufacturers, and widget components mounted by other creators), it will not be considered a new user, and its game consumption will not be included in the aforementioned game consumption.","refers_to_the_fee_that_the_company_and/or_affiliated_companies_and_game_manufact":"Refers to the fee that the company and/or affiliated companies and game manufacturers should pay to the provider of the payment channel in order to obtain the payment service provided by the payment channel. The channel fees required by different payment channels may not be the same, and the specific policies of each payment channel shall prevail.","refers_to_the_promotion_mode__based_on_your_use_of_game_sharing_and_promotion_fu":"Refers to the promotion mode, based on your use of game sharing and promotion functions, publishing videos for Cloud gaming promotion (hereinafter referred to as \\"promotion\\"), the total amount of money paid by new users for consumption in Cloud gaming within 60 days (calculated from the date of activation of the user), excluding bad debts and the amount of game coins or virtual items or gift packs provided to users by the company and/or affiliates, game manufacturers, etc. Game consumption generated by new users through other channels, methods or other people\'s promotion and activation of the Cloud gaming, or game consumption generated after 60 days of activation by you, will not be included in the aforementioned total game consumption, and the company does not need to pay you any income based on this.","refers_to_the_revenue_generated_by_the_in_game_advertising_space_due_to_the_acce":"Refers to the revenue generated by the in-game advertising space due to the acceptance of advertising in the promotion mode (if any, the actual amount of net income recorded shall prevail). In-game advertising: refers to the advertising introduced by the game manufacturer and the Internet advertising media platform and displayed on the game client side.","refers_to_the_sum_of_the_total_game_consumption_plus_advertising_revenue__and_th":"Refers to the sum of the total game consumption plus advertising revenue, and the amount after deducting payment channel fees.","refers_to_the_total_game_consumption_after_deducting_payment_channel_fees_":"Refers to the total game consumption after deducting payment channel fees.","refresh":"refresh","regarding_the_various_rules__notices__prompts_and_other_information_of_this_func":"Regarding the various rules, notices, prompts and other information of this function, Douyin may send you one or more of the methods such as webpage announcements, webpage prompts, email addresses, mobile phone text messages, and in-app letters sent in the management system of the user\'s registered Douyin account. Once such information is published or sent by Douyin in any of the aforementioned methods, it is deemed that you have accepted and agreed, and it is binding on you. If you do not accept it, you can immediately stop using this function.","registration_price":"Registration price","regular_release":"Schedule","related_topic":"related topic","releas