deo_content_format__you_":"When uploading the video, correctly set the panoramic video content format, you can enter the work release page, edit and publish the panoramic video. (Currently only the isometric columnar projection panoramic video output by the panoramic video camera is supported)","when_you_use_this_function__you_should_also_abide_by_the_provisions_of_pico_s__p":"When you use this function, you should also abide by the provisions of PICO\'s \\"PICO End User Licensing Agreement\\", \\"PICO Privacy Policy\\", \\"PICO Video User Service Agreement\\" and \\"PICO Video Privacy Policy\\". PICO has the right to take management measures such as review and deletion of the content you sync to PICO.","whether_to_authorize_douyin_to_play_in_pico":"Whether to authorize Douyin to play in PICO","whether_to_display_the_external_chapter_progress_bar":"Whether to display the external chapter progress bar","whether_to_prioritize_column_display":"Whether to prioritize column display","whether_to_remove_the_product":"Whether to remove the product","while_the_work_is_being_uploaded__you_can_continue_to_browse_the_website__but_do":"While the work is being uploaded, you can continue to browse the website, but do not close the page.","who_can_watch?":"Who can watch?","who_can_watch_the_watermelon_video?":"Who can watch the watermelon video?","will_keep_pace_with_your_exclusive_membership_price":"Will keep pace with your exclusive membership price","will_lead_to_a_decrease_in_the_flow_of_works":"Will lead to a decrease in the flow of works","wisteria":"Wisteria","without_actively_setting_the_cover_of_the_work__a_good_cover_can_attract_more_pe":"Without actively setting the cover of the work, a good cover can attract more people to browse the work","work":"work","work_activity_reward":"Activity","work_content_change_prompt":"Work content change prompt","work_description":"Description","work_description_minimum_{douyin_desc_min_length}_words":"Work description Minimum {DOUYIN_DES