s (including but not limited to reproduction rights, translation rights, compilation rights, information network dissemination rights, adaptation rights, and the right to make derivatives, performances and displays, etc.), the scope of use of the above rights includes but is not limited to current or other websites, applications, products, etc Or end point devices, etc. You hereby acknowledge and agree that both Douyin and PICO have the right to use and otherwise develop the Content (in whole or in part) in connection with any publicity, promotion, advertising, marketing and/or research relating to the foregoing, \\"Douyin\\", \\"PICO\\" software and related services, the Company and/or the Company\'s brand, solely or by third parties. For the avoidance of doubt, you understand and agree that the rights granted above include rights and licenses to use, reproduce and display personal images, likenesses, names, trademarks, service marks, brands, names, logos and company marks (if any) and any other branding, marketing or promotion assets, materials, materials, etc. that you own or are licensed to use and implant in the Content. Based on the features of some features, the content you publish through this feature (including but not limited to the sounds, audio or conversations contained in the content) is available to other Douyin and/or PICO users.","you_acknowledge_and_agree_that_douyin_and/or_pico_may__in_its_sole_discretion_an":"You acknowledge and agree that Douyin and/or PICO may, in its sole discretion and without prior notice to you, discontinue (permanently or temporarily) the provision of this feature to you. You may also discontinue the use of this feature at any time.","you_acknowledge_and_agree_that_the_company_may_decide_to_remove_the_game_based_o":"You acknowledge and agree that the company may decide to remove the game based on business conditions, business strategies, cooperation conditions, etc. From the time the game is removed from the shelves, the distributable income will no longer be calculated, and the company will no longer need to pay you any income for the game.","you_agree_that_all_content_published_by_your_account_of__douyin__software_and_re":"You agree that all content published by your account of \\"Douyin\\" software and related services and corresponding accounts is authorized to be automatically and synchronously published to PICO with your account.","you_are_a_national_institution/news_media_account_in_douyin__according_to_the_re":"You are a national institution/news media account in Douyin. According to the requirements of the platform, the bound Watermelon Video account must be certified as \\"institutional government\\" or \\"institutional media. Please replace the account that meets the requirements and bind again.","you_are_invited_to_experience_the_test_function__and_the_video_transaction_volum":"You are invited to experience the test function, and the video transaction volume can be increased by about < span style = \\"color: #FE2C55;\\" > 15% </span >","you_are_invited_to_experience_the_test_function__and_you_can_earn_more_commissio":"You are invited to experience the test function, and you can earn more commissions after opening it.","you_can_add_up_to_{cart_limit}_items":"You can add up to {CART_LIMIT} items","you_can_add_up_to_{max_challenge}_topics":"You can add up to {MAX_CHALLENGE} topics","you_can_add_up_to_{maxcount}_topics":"You can add up to {maxCount} topics","you_can_add_up_to_{placeholder1}_co_creators":"You can add up to {placeholder1} co-creators","you_can_adjust_the_size_and_position_of_the_sticker_in_the_video_preview_area_":"You can adjust the size and position of the sticker in the video preview area.","you_can_apply_to_be_associated_with_a_hotspot__if_the_video_is_indeed_very_relat":"You can apply to be associated with a hotspot. If the video is indeed very related to the hotspot, it will enter the Douyin hotspot list. If it is not related, it will not take effect.","you_can_confirm_now__or_you_can_deal_with_it_later_on_the_mobile_terminal_or_cre":"You can confirm now, or you can deal with it later on the mobile terminal or creator center.","you_can_drag_the_selection_with_the_mouse_to_select_the_cover_you_want_to_select":"You can drag the selection with the mouse to select the cover you want to select.","you_can_drag_the_video_screen_to_watch_during_playback_":"You can drag the video screen to watch during playback.","you_can_get_watermelon_video_revenue_after_synchronizing_horizontal_screen_video":"You can get watermelon video revenue after synchronizing horizontal screen videos","you_can_go_to_the_mobile_end_to_appeal__see_the_detailed_rules":"You can go to the mobile end to appeal, see the detailed rules","you_can_only_save_after_adding_the_chapter_title_":"You can only save after adding the chapter title.","you_can_refer_to_the_format_screen_example_to_choose_your_panoramic_video_type_":"You can refer to the format screen example to choose your panoramic video type.","you_can_try_to_re_upload_again_":"You can try to re-upload again.","you_fully_understand_that_simultaneous_authorization_does_not_mean_that_douyin_p":"You fully understand that simultaneous authorization does not mean that Douyin promises to immediately and completely synchronize your publishing, modification, deletion and other operations of Douyin content to PICO. In case of technical restrictions, application function differences, copyright authorization scope restrictions, operational strategy differences and other reasons, your content published by Douyin or related operations cannot be synchronized to PICO in a timely and complete manner, Douyin and/or PICO shall not assume any legal responsibility.","you_have_joined_media_video_partner__go_to_watermelon_now":"You have joined Media Video Partner, go to Watermelon now","you_have_joined_media_video_partner__synchronize_original_content_on_horizontal_":"You have joined Media Video Partner, synchronize original content on horizontal screen for more than 1 minute, and enjoy the traffic sharing of Douyin, Watermelon, and Toutiao!","you_have_not_bound_the_taobao_alliance_pid__and_you_will_not_get_commission_inco":"You have not bound the Taobao Alliance PID, and you will not get commission income for adding products. If you want to add Taobao products, please go to \\"Douyin App-Show Window-Personal Avatar-Taobao Account Binding\\" for PID binding.","you_haven_t_operated_for_a_long_time__do_you_want_to_continue_editing?":"You haven\'t operated for a long time. Do you want to continue editing?","you_inform_any_other_third_party_of_the_unpublished_information_of_douyin_withou":"You inform any other third party of the unpublished information of Douyin without the prior written consent of Douyin.","you_provide_or_transfer_this_function_or_any_documents__pictures__technical_inte":"You provide or transfer this function or any documents, pictures, technical interfaces involved in this function to any other third party, or use the functions, information, content or services provided by Douyin to engage in any commercial activities other than this Agreement.","you_shall_not_use_any_improper_means_to_engage_in_corruptive_practices__and_shal":"You shall not use any improper means to engage in corruptive practices, and shall ensure that your promotion behavior does not violate any laws and regulations, violate social morals/public order and good customs, infringe on the legitimate rights and interests of third parties, or violate platform norms such as the Game Sharing and Promotion Function Agreement and the relevant management rules of the promoted game itself. Otherwise, the platform has the right to independently judge and take pre-warning measures according to the severity of the situation, refuse to publish, immediately stop transmitting information, delete the published content, deactivate or close the game sharing and promotion function within a certain period of time, terminate the provision of game sharing and promotion functions, do not settle all or part of the unsettled/unwithdrawn game promotion income, restrict some or all functions of the account until permanently close the account.","you_shall_not_use_any_improper_means_to_engage_in_corruptive_practices__and_shal_2":"You shall not use any improper means to engage in corruptive practices, and shall ensure that your promotion behavior does not violate any laws and regulations, violate social morals/public order and good customs, infringe on the legitimate rights and interests of third parties, or violate platform norms such as the Game Sharing and Promotion Function Agreement and the relevant management rules of the promoted game itself. Otherwise, the platform has the right to independently judge and take pre-warning measures according to the severity of the situation, refuse to publish, immediately stop transmitting information, delete the published content, deactivate or close the game sharing and promotion function within a certain period of time, terminate the provision of game sharing and promotion functions, do not settle all or part of the unsettled/unwithdrawn game promotion income, restrict some or all functions of the account until permanently close the account.","you_should_ensure_that_the_game_you_intend_to_promote_is_selected_according_to_y":"You should ensure that the game you intend to promote is selected according to your live broadcast/video theme, ensure that the relevant information content of your game promotion is related to the game you are explaining, and must not be forcibly implanted in the promotion (that is, the video/live broadcast theme content is completely unrelated or weakly related to the promotion of the game), and must not use screens and split screens unrelated to the promotion of the game in the video/live broadcast; before the game promotion in the live broadcast room, please be sure to select your go LIVE classification according to your actual live broadcast content (Douyin -\u201c+\u201d- live stream - mobile game - select live broadcast content).","you_should_ensure_that_you_enjoy_all_legal_rights_to_the_videos_and_any_content_":"You should ensure that you enjoy all legal rights to the videos and any content and elements published through this function, and such content does not violate the platform rules of Douyin and PICO such as laws and regulations, moral customs, \\"Douyin User Service Agreement\\", etc., and does not violate the intellectual property rights, privacy rights and other legitimate rights and interests of any third party. Otherwise, all consequences and losses caused shall be borne by you. If any losses are caused to Douyin and/or PICO, you shall pay full compensation.","you_understand_and_agree_that_if_douyin_finds_or_receives_reports_or_complaints_":"You understand and agree that if Douyin finds or receives reports or complaints from others that a user violates this Agreement, Douyin has the right to delete or block the relevant content at any time without notice, and impose penalties on the offending user according to the circumstances of the behavior, including but not limited to warning, restricting or prohibiting the use of some or all functions, and suspending the service until termination.","you_understand_and_agree_that_if_the_following_circumstances_occur__douyin_has_t":"You understand and agree that if the following circumstances occur, Douyin has the right to: immediately suspend, suspend, stop or permanently refuse your use of this function, and deal with you in accordance with relevant agreements and rules; at the same time, Douyin has the right to recover from you the resulting liquidated damages or damages.","you_understand_and_agree_that_you_shall_be_solely_responsible_for_any_claims__de":"You understand and agree that you shall be solely responsible for any claims, demands or losses claimed by third parties due to your violation of this Agreement or related agreements and rules; if Douyin and/or PICO suffer losses as a result, you shall also be responsible for full compensation.","you_use_this_feature_for_illegal_purposes_":"You use this feature for illegal purposes.","you_will_lose_the_content_you_are_editing__are_you_sure_you_want_to_cancel?":"You will lose the content you are editing. Are you sure you want to cancel?","your_account_is_illegal":"Your account is illegal","your_account_s_avatar__nickname__interactive_information_(including_but_not_limi":"Your account\'s avatar, nickname, interactive information (including but not limited to comments, favorites, likes) and other public information will also be synchronized together.","your_behavior_violates_the_relevant_provisions_of_the__douyin_user_service_agree":"Your behavior violates the relevant provisions of the \\"Douyin User Service Agreement\\" and \\"Douyin Community Guidelines\\" for user behavior norms;","your_video_content_has_been_modified__please_check_whether_the_content_of_the_or":"Your video content has been modified, please check whether the content of the original chapter is accurate; if you close the pop-up window, the currently filled content will be lost. Confirm closing?","your_video_is_too_short_to_set_a_trial_":"Your video is too short to set a trial.","your_work_may_be_displayed_in_a_horizontal_cover_style_on_multiple_pages_such_as":"Your work may be displayed in a horizontal cover style on multiple pages such as Featured Channel and Douyin Featured Computer. Setting it up immediately may help the work get more traffic.","your_work_may_be_displayed_in_a_vertical_cover_style_on_multiple_pages_such_as_d":"Your work may be displayed in a vertical cover style on multiple pages such as Douyin Featured APP, personal page, search, etc. Setting it up immediately may help the work get more traffic.","your_work_may_be_displayed_on_multiple_pages_such_as_douyin_featured_app__for_yo":"Your work may be displayed on multiple pages such as Douyin Featured APP, For